  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution contains three programme areas and is an interim support to the Swedish Helsinki Committee in the areas of Rule of Law, Anti-Discrimination and Freedom of Expression. The overall objective is to promote and strengthen access to civil human rights by channelling funds to Moldovan NGOs in order for them to implement specific projects within the three programme areas.</narrative>
